      "writtenOn": "2025-05-19T18:51:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No it is not input to silego chip. EC_PG3 is going to LDO (RT6585BGQW in page no. 268) as PRIM_VR_EN (through switch (SW8U2 -\u003e pin s3-s6 closed)) to further generate power good signal.",
      "parentUuid": "a35afc82_7d6602be",
